A. Sophie Blee-Goldman created KAFKA-16871:
----------------------------------------------

             Summary: Clean up internal AssignmentConfigs class in Streams
                 Key: KAFKA-16871
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16871
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: A. Sophie Blee-Goldman


In KIP-924 we added a new public AssignmentConfigs class to hold all of the, you guessed it, assignment related configs.

However, there is an existing config class of the same name and largely the same contents but that's in an internal package, specifically inside the AssignorConfiguration class.

We should remove the old AssignmentConfigs class that's in AssignorConfiguration and replace any usages of it with the new public AssignmentConfigs that we added in KIP-924



--
