             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: jiandu


Currently, the {{SystemTime}} class, which provides system time-related fun=
ctionalities such as getting the current timestamp =E3=80=81sleep=E3=80=81a=
nd await can be instantiated multiple times.

Howerver,=C2=A0 system time is unique=EF=BC=8CIn an application, the time o=
btained in different places should be consistent,=C2=A0 But now the time ob=
tained by using the Java System class to interact with the underlying layer=
 is the same=E3=80=82

So I suggest changing it to a singleton mode=EF=BC=8C reflect the uniquenes=
s of system time in design

=C2=A0



