hich will invoke {{AssignmentEvent}} [here|https://github.com/apache/kafka/=
blob/trunk/core/src/main/scala/kafka/server/ReplicaManager.scala#L2748]. Wi=
th that, we'll get the unexpected {{NOT_LEADER_OR_FOLLOWER}} error.
