Fan Yang created KAFKA-16893:
--------------------------------

             Summary: ConnectorUtils can groups elements in round-robin fashion
                 Key: KAFKA-16893
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16893
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: connect
            Reporter: Fan Yang
            Assignee: Fan Yang


Current ConnectorUtils can only assign continuous elements in groups. But in some scenario, continuous elements need to be distributed in different groups.
So, we can add round-robin assignment strategy.



