Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-16937:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Consider inlineing Time#waitObject to ProducerMetadata#awaitUpdate
                 Key: KAFKA-16937
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16937
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


Time#waitObject is implemented by while-loop and it is used by `ProducerMetadata` only. Hence, this jira can include following changes:

1. move `Time#waitObject` to  `ProducerMetadata#awaitUpdate`
2. ProducerMetadata#awaitUpdate can throw "exact" TimeoutException [0]

