Hi Josep,

KIP-966 is not needed for feature parity with ZK. Indeed, KIP-966 will n=
ot be implemented in ZK at all (and never was).

There is a PR related to honoring dynamic configs for unclean.leader.ele=
ction which we did agree to do for 3.8. It's under review and we hope to=
 get it in soon.

We still plan on having KIP-853 in 3.8. In fact, it will be the main fea=
ture of that release.

best,
Colin

