Colin McCabe created KAFKA-16952:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Do not bump broker epoch when re-registering the same incarnation
                 Key: KAFKA-16952
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16952
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Colin McCabe
            Assignee: Colin McCabe


Do not bump broker epoch when re-registering the same incarnation. This could create problems for KIP-966, which assumes broker epochs reflect broker lifecycles.



