Hi Mickael,

I agree +1 to proceeding with the 3.8 release on-time.

I'm fine with cutting the 3.9 branch immediately after the Kraft KIPS are
feature-complete, or 4 months after the 3.8 release, whichever comes first.

Thanks,
Greg

