Hi all,

Based on the discussion in the 3.8 release thread, we will need a 3.9 release. I guess I should create a new email thread to discuss this.

I'd like to volunteer as release manager for the Apache Kafka 3.9.0 release. There's a release plan here: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Release+Plan+3.9.0

best,
Colin

