I would suggest going from 2=2E6=2E2 to 3=2E6=2E2 and then stopping and wai=
ting until 3=2E7=2E1 comes out=2E There is a pretty serious flaw in 3=2E7=
=2E0 that hit us and we ended up having to downgrade to 3=2E6=2E2 to recove=
r=2E The bug is fixed but not going to be released until 3=2E7=2E1 comes ou=
t=2E The bug prevented metadata from being readable and thus anytime a node=
 restarted (including the kraft server itself), it could never come back on=
line or be unregistered from the cluster either=2E

Sejal [Patel] | CTO
