Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-16975:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: The error message of creating `__cluster_metadata` should NOT be "Authorization failed" 
                 Key: KAFKA-16975
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16975
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


The error message of creating "__cluster_metadata" by admin is "Authorization failed.". That could confuse users that it implies you "can" create it in using root. However, the fact is that we DISALLOW users to create it as a regular topic even though you are the boss :)



