--00000000000044aa79061b12cf60
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

We can use the console-consumer to read the contents of the
`__remote_log_metadata` topic. Why are we proposing a new tool?

sh kafka-console-consumer.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --topic
__remote_log_metadata  --consumer-property exclude.internal.topics=3Dfalse
--formatter
org.apache.kafka.server.log.remote.metadata.storage.serialization.RemoteLog=
MetadataSerde\$RemoteLogMetadataFormatter
--from-beginning



