Hi Sejal,
Thanks for reaching out.

What would be your recommended strategy to go from 2.2.1 into 3.6.2 version=
? Can we securely do it in one jump or we should use some step in between (=
e.g. to jump form 2.2.1 to 2.6.2 and then from 2.6.2 to 3.6.2)?

Thanks,

