 3.7.0. And I would suggest probably seeing what the official migration gui=
des have to say because my understanding is that the bulk of the changes si=
nce we started the migration is around making sure it is a smooth and safe =
upgrade process overall.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The other option that you could always do (our fallb=
ack plan) is to spinup a brand new cluster and to copy all the topics from =
