I think it's better to suppress the response in v3. The issue with modif=
ying it is that there may be scenarios where [1, 1] is the actual suppor=
ted range, and we'd want to know that. But leaving out the feature shoul=
d be OK for older clients (it will be the case with clients old enough t=
o send a v0, v1, or v2 ApiVersionsRequest anyway)

best,
Colin

On Fri, Jun 21, 2024, at 16:46, Justine Olshan wrote:
> Thanks Colin,
>
