>>>>>>>>> (the
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> latter looks like just a more verbose way to express the
>>>> former,
>>>>>>>>> and
>>>>>>>>>> it
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> would be intuitive if it behaves the same) would throw if the
