>            Reporter: Dongjin Lee
>            Assignee: xuanzhang gong
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 3.9.0
>
>
> As of present, Kafka uses a relatively strict code style for Java code, e=
xcept import order. For this reason, the code formatting settings of every =
local dev environment are different from person to person, resulting in cou=
ntless meaningless import order changes in the PR.
> This issue aims to define and apply a 3-group import order, like the foll=
owing:
> 1. Project packages: {{kafka.*}}, {{org.apache.kafka.*}}=20
> 2. Third Party packages: {{com.*}}, {{net.*}}, {{org.*}}
> 3. Java packages: {{java.*}}, {{javax.*}}
