All of the tests in KafkakRaftClientTest and KafkaRaftClientSnapshotTest us=
e well known ids like 0, 1, etc. Because of this those tests were not able =
to catch a bug in the BeginQuorumEpoch schema were the default value for Vo=
terId was 0 instead of -1.

Improve those tests by using random positive numbers to lower the probabili=
ty that they will match the default value of a schema.



